    <!-- ── ALONG-TUNNEL WALKERS (X direction) — workers patrolling ── -->






    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         STATIC OBSTACLES — 17 realistic mining objects (68%)
         Mix of: rock piles, mine carts, timber support beams, equipment
         crates, barrel drums, pipe stacks, ventilation ducts, rubble
         ★ Several placed ON / NEAR the X centreline (Y≈0) to force
           lateral avoidance — essential for DRL training
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

    <!-- ── Rock pile: large irregular boulder at X=14, centre-left (Y=0.3) ── -->
